# fixedbugs, defect 2049, 2026-10-13, a function other than `main`.
#
# SYMPTOM: a header of the program's own declaring the C name of the
# program's function `helper` another way was told `internal error:
# compiling the generated C failed` at exit 2, clang's first error in the
# generated C.
#
# FIX: the header is refused at its line 3, exit 1, as the second
# reproducer is (`cli/declared_after.hero`).

extern "fixedbugs-2049-a-header-that-declares-a-function-s-c-name-is-refused.h"  #~ ffi_header_refused
    function eight() -> i32

function helper() -> i32
    return 7

function main()
    print(eight() + helper())
